# Compiler 2 — AST and 50 checkers
# Owns AST node definitions, compact AST storage, traversal utilities and 50
# individually named AST validation/checker passes.
# TODO: define stable node kinds and source spans, then implement checker registry.
# Checker contract: inspect AST, report deterministic diagnostics, return failure on
# invalid structure, and never mutate source semantics silently.
# The 50-checker inventory and tests will be maintained in AST_CHECKERS.md.
# No checker is considered implemented until it has behavior and a regression test.
